{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10881","headline":"雨二首 一 · 杜甫","name":"雨二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青山澹无姿，白露谁能数。\n片片水上云，萧萧沙中雨。\n殊俗状巢居，曾台俯风渚。\n佳客适万里，沈思情延伫。\n挂帆远色外，惊浪满吴楚。\n久阴蛟螭出，寇盗复几许。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《杜诗详注》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/杜詩詳註_(四庫全書本)）"}